'''Gory Groom''' (ゴリ婿 ''Gori Muko'') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] variant of [[Gory Dark]] introduced in [[The Forbidden Bride (Monthly Event)|The Forbidden Bride]]. He was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.7 Update|Version 2.2.7]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

