==Enemy==
Gory Groom, although not as speedy as his counterpart, [[Gory Dark]], shares many similarities with him in both stats and appearance. He has a very fast attack rate, decent range, high DPS, and Area Attack. Unlike his counterpart, he has the [[Base Destroyer]] ability, so he can destroy your base in a couple of hits if you are not careful.

==Strategy==
Due to his high knockback count, the simplest way to defeat him is to stack DPS cats with decent range like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], or [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]]. [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|Anti-Dark cats]] like [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Weightlifter Cat]] will make quick work of him as well.

Like most [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemies, two de-synced [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercats]] are enough to perma-[[Freeze|freeze]] him.

