==Trivia==
*Gory Groom's Japanese name, Gori Muko (ゴリ婿), is derived from ''gorilla'' and 入婿 ''irimuko'' (live-in son-in-law).
*Gory Groom appears to be blushing, as he has a small pink spot on his cheeks.
*Gory Groom may be a reference to [[wikia:gintama:Princess Bubbles|Princess Bubbles]] from the anime series ''[[wikipedia:Gintama|Gintama]]''.
*Gory Groom was originally a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]]/[[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemy. This seems to have been changed some time after [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]].

